#: src/view.cpp:1375
msgid "Frame Limit"
msgstr "Límite fotogramas"

#: src/view.cpp:1376
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Maximum number of frames per second.\n"
#| "Be careful: The higher the limit the more insensitive your mouse might "
#| "become to slow movements (because relative motion is used and program "
#| "cycles are shorter).\n"
#| "200 FPS should be a good value."
msgid ""
"Maximum number of frames per second.\n"
"Be careful: The higher the limit the more insensitive your mouse might "
"become to slow movements if relative motion is used as program cycles get "
"shorter.\n"
"60 FPS should be a good value."
msgstr ""
"Número máximo de fotogramas por segundo.\n"
"Ten cuidado: cuanto mayor sea el límite, más insensible podría volverse el "
"ratón a movimientos lentos (porque se utiliza una moción relativa y los "
"ciclos del programa son más cortos).\n"
"200 FPS normalmente es un buen valor."

